      },
      "text": "Packaging connects the die to the outside world — power, signals, cooling — while\nprotecting it physically. Modern packaging has evolved from simple wire bonding to\ncomplex 3D stacks with TSVs, hybrid bonding, and chiplet architectures that are\nnow a core part of the performance scaling roadmap."
    },
