        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Packaging - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "DIE LEVEL (bare silicon chip)\n  │\n  ▼ First-level interconnect (connects die to package)\nPACKAGE (IC package)\n  Wire bond / Flip-chip / Embedded / Fan-out WLP\n  │\n  ▼ Second-level interconnect (connects package to PCB)\nPCB (Printed Circuit Board)\n  BGA solder balls / LGA pads / QFP leads\n  │\n  ▼ System-level\nSYSTEM (server, phone, car module)"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-PACKAGING.md#005",
      "path": [
        "07-PACKAGING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
