        "root_concepts": "[packaging]",
        "section": "semiconductor-manufacturing",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Packaging - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "ADVANCED PACKAGING (2.5D / 3D):\n  Interposer or bridge connects multiple dies in same package\n  → \"System in Package\" (SiP): near-die integration of memory + logic\n  → Near-chiplet performance with mix-and-match fabrication\n```"
    },
