      "text": "PROCESS:\n  Wafer-level: deposit UBM (Under-Bump Metallurgy: Ti/NiV/Cu) → electro-plate SnAg\n  Reflow: solder wets to substrate pads → self-aligns (surface tension)\n  Underfill: capillary-fill epoxy between die and substrate → CTE mismatch relief"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-PACKAGING.md#020",
      "path": [
        "07-PACKAGING.md"
      ],
