        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Packaging - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "UNDERFILL:\n  Die: Si, CTE = 3 ppm/°C\n  Organic substrate: CTE = 14-18 ppm/°C\n  Temperature cycles (−40 to +125°C): 100+ ppm strain differential → solder fatigue\n  Underfill epoxy distributes stress across entire die-substrate interface → reliability"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-PACKAGING.md#021",
      "path": [
        "07-PACKAGING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
