        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Packaging - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "ADVANTAGES OVER WIRE BOND:\n  Much higher I/O count (area array, not perimeter only) → 10,000+ I/O on large die\n  Lower inductance (shorter path)\n  Better electrical performance (signal integrity, power delivery)\n  Smaller package footprint"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-PACKAGING.md#022",
