        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Packaging - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SUBSTRATE (flip-chip BGA):\n  Organic laminate: FR4 or ABF (Ajinomoto Build-up Film)\n  Fine lines: 8/8 µm (line/space) → 2/2 µm (advanced ABF)\n  RDL (redistribution layer): routes from bump pitch to BGA ball pitch\n```"
