      },
      "text": "CONCEPT:\n  No traditional substrate — RDL built directly around die\n  \"Fan-out\": I/O extends beyond die footprint using embedded routing"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-PACKAGING.md#027",
      "path": [
        "07-PACKAGING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:semiconductor-manufacturing:07-packaging, git-history:semiconductor-manufacturing:07-packaging]",
