        "root_concepts": "[packaging]",
        "section": "semiconductor-manufacturing",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Packaging - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "PROCESS:\n  1. Pick dies → embed in molding compound (reconstituted wafer)\n  2. CMP flatten to expose die back + mold compound surface\n  3. Build RDL (redistribution layers) directly on top of die + mold\n  4. Solder balls on RDL\n  5. Dice into individual packages"
    },
